## Criteria and verdicts

{% include 'shared/_criterion_verification_procedure.j2' %}

For each unchanged request criterion and every required plan reference whose independently derived disposition is `adapted`, `not_applicable`, or `blocked`, emit one stable `DA-###` item in `## Criterion Verdicts` with `Criterion:`, `Expected observation:`, `Verdict:`, `Evidence:`, and `Location:`. Audit these independently derived plan dispositions even when the request criteria otherwise pass. `completed` requires every criterion to be `met` with evidence and no counterexample found. For `request_changes` or `failed`, mirror each localized non-met verdict in `## What Came Up Short`; do not request or prescribe a remedy. A `not evaluable` criterion requires `failed`.

## Decision artifact

